<title>USA: Applied Cellular names Loppert CFO.</title>
<headline>Applied Cellular names Loppert CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NIXA, Mo. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Cellular Technology Inc Thursday said it named David Loppert as chief financial officer, effective February 3, 1997.</p>
<p>Loppert has over 18 years of experience in financial executive positions, six of which were as a senior manager with Price Waterhouse in Los Angeles and in international offices, Applied Cellular said.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said Applied Cellular did not previously have an acting CFO.</p>
